# Normalize line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf rewrites checkouts to CRLF on this Windows machine while the Linux CI runner sees
# whatever is in the repository. Without this file the two disagree, and the first symptom is
# `dart format --set-exit-if-changed` failing in CI and nowhere else, which is a miserable thing
# to debug. Everything is stored and checked out as LF; the toolchain is fine with it on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except the formats that genuinely require CRLF on Windows.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary, so git never tries to translate anything.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.m4b binary
*.mp3 binary
